write(p,dict(status='registered_not_implemented_not_submitted',research_complete=False,question='Can gating only the active soft preference by the actual setup-search criticality prevent stale low-criticality guidance from disturbing routing, while preserving the stored plan and original native congestion?',evidence=dict(source='outside_quality_summary_01.json',sha256=sha(D/'outside_quality_summary_01.json'),guide_searches=3809,actual_below_planning_threshold=453,planning_threshold_native_float=r['actual_below_planning_mincrit']['threshold'],scope='Repeated trajectory events on one seen circuit; existing consumer has no equivalent actual-criticality eligibility gate. Outside DP changed plans and removed96guided-cross evaluations but native heap counts/finalroute/CPD remained unchanged.'),method='Separate flag, defaultoff. At the actual setup connection search, use local cost-parameter copy and suppress only method preference when actual criticality is strictly below existing configured planning mincriticality. Do not clear stored guide or replan, prune native edges, alter base congestion/Tdel/STA or RCV. If criticality rises later, same stored plan is available. Explicit native-float boundary handling; eligibility gating is not new delay confidence.',controls='New binary defaultoff exact frozen currentC2/Qs; same parameters, no outside eta/scoring, threshold0 compatibility where applicable. Gate-on count2 and count1 same-setting prefix check. Existing DP/query/delay/source-reverse flags unchanged; no increased budgets. Use actual gated-search/edge contribution counts, all statuses/CPD/tails/SB-CB/iters/planning/probe/fullprocess costs.',limits=dict(seconds=1800,memory_bytes=64*1024**3,disk_reserve_bytes=80*1024**3),qualification='Logical guide eligibility consistency is a hypothesis, not an inferred cause of current CPD degradation. Low-criticality miss events are a small part of total guided crossing work, so measure actual effects before expanding or combining. Outside branch not promoted; do not keep increasing its benefit or query budgets without new evidence.'))
